  "readme": [
    "Two kinds of number live in this file and they are never mixed.",
    "  actual   — a closing rank/score that a named source reports for a named",
    "             year, quota, category and round. It carries a URL and the date",
    "             it was checked. The app labels it VERIFIED and shows the source.",
    "  forecast — DISHA's own projection. The app labels it FORECAST. It is never",
    "             presented as a published cut-off.",
    "confidence: 'official'   = read from the admitting body (JoSAA, MCC, NTA)",
    "            'aggregator' = a reputable secondary site quoting official data",
    "            'conflict'   = sources disagree; the app shows both and says so",
    "Only tracks with an 'actual' array have been verified. Everything else is",
    "forecast-only until someone does the work and adds a sourced row.",
    "watch[].mirrors: secondary pages used only to DETECT that something was published when the official site refuses our request. Never a source of truth — the figure is still read and entered by a person."
  ],
